Here:

# meson setup build -Dmodule-gpgsql=static
# meson compile -C build
# meson install -C build

In pdns/recursordist:

# meson setup build
# meson compile -C build
# meson install -C build

In pdns/dnsdistdist:

# meson setup build -Dyaml=auto
# meson compile -C build
# meson install -C build

However, to get all this to work, I had to create a simplistic pkgconfig file for Boost:

# cat > /usr/pkg/lib/pkgconfig/boost.pc <<EOF
prefix=/usr/pkg
exec_prefix=${prefix}
libdir=${exec_prefix}/lib
includedir=${prefix}/include/boost

Name: Boost
Description: Boost
Version: 1.92.0
Libs: -L${exec_prefix}/lib  -lboost_stacktrace_dump -lboost_contract -lboost_random -lboost_timer -lboost_type_erasure -lboost_stacktrace_basic -lboost_math_tr1 -lboost_test_exec_monitor -lboost_graph -lboost_container -lboost_context -lboost_process -lboost_thread -lboost_unit_test_framework -lboost_regex -lboost_math_c99l -lboost_log -lboost_prg_exec_monitor -lboost_atomic -lboost_wserialization -lboost_nowide -lboost_chrono -lboost_math_c99f -lboost_stacktrace_noop -lboost_math_c99 -lboost_filesystem -lboost_log_setup -lboost_program_options -lboost_serialization -lboost_exception -lboost_wave -lboost_json -lboost_date_time -lboost_url -lboost_coroutine -lboost_fiber -lboost_stacktrace_from_exception -lboost_math_tr1l -lboost_charconv -lboost_locale -lboost_math_tr1f -lboost_iostreams -lboost_stacktrace_addr2line
Cflags: -I${includedir}
EOF



PREVIOUSLY:

Everywhere, before configuring: make distclean; autoreconf -vi

Here: ./configure --with-modules='gpgsql' --with-dynmodules=''

In pdns/recursordist: ./configure --enable-dns-over-tls

In pdns/dnsdistdist: ./configure LIBEDIT_CFLAGS="-I/usr/include" LIBEDIT_LIBS="-L/usr/lib -ledit"
...or...
./configure LIBEDIT_CFLAGS="-I/usr/include" LIBEDIT_LIBS="-L/usr/lib -ledit" --enable-dnscrypt
...or...
./configure LIBEDIT_CFLAGS="-I/usr/include" LIBEDIT_LIBS="-L/usr/lib -ledit" --enable-dns-over-tls
...or...
./configure LIBEDIT_CFLAGS="-I/usr/include" LIBEDIT_LIBS="-L/usr/lib -ledit" --enable-dns-over-https
...or indeed...
./configure LIBEDIT_CFLAGS="-I/usr/include" LIBEDIT_LIBS="-L/usr/lib -ledit" --enable-dnscrypt --enable-dns-over-tls --enable-dns-over-https

Also, for some reason, on aarch64 I have to add "--with-boost=/usr/pkg" to everything.
